    "description": {
      "value": "<p dir=\"ltr\">This black canister has gray marks tracing holes that will produce large quantities of smoke in a short period of time.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"> </p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">As an action, you can throw the grenade to a point on the ground you can see within 60 feet of you. Where the grenade lands, a 20-foot-radius sphere of smoke will appear. The smoke spreads around corners, and its area is heavily obscured. It lasts for one minute, or until a wind of moderate or greater speed (at least 10 miles per hour) disperses it.</p>",
